  "prefLabel": "Env-Dw 103.19 Distribution system",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Dw 103.19 “Distribution system” means that portion of the public water system which includes pipes, storage facilities, pressure booster facilities, and all measuring and control devices used to convey potable water to the system users.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Env-Dw 100) #10606, eff 6-1-14",
